        "animation": {
          "delivery": "stream",
          "maxFps": 1,
          "notes": "Frames are written by FiestaBoard one at a time (transition plugins step frame-by-frame); the board's own flap cascade animates each write. ~1 frame/s is the practical ceiling for legible flap motion on the local API. Cloud connections are additionally floored by FiestaBoard at one write per 15 s (transport policy, not device capability).",
          "sources": [
